D. EXACT CONSTANTS FOR THE MIGRATED GATE (derived from ny alone)
====================================================================================================

    ny     dp/dx (exact)              dp/dx    rel err vs continuum    drop ratio
     8          -256/215 -1.190697674418605       1/129 = 7.751938e-03       128/129
    12        -1728/1445 -1.195847750865052       1/289 = 3.460208e-03       288/289
    18        -3888/3245 -1.198151001540832       1/649 = 1.540832e-03       648/649
